                            	  4912: UpdateDodongoState_JumpTable:
02:0003A3C2 0003A3CE        	  4913:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState0_Move   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003A3C6 0003A432        	  4914:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState1_Bloated   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:0003A3CA 0003A42C        	  4915:     dc.l    UpdateDodongoState2_Stunned   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
