                            	  5627: AnimateBoomerangAndCheckCollision:
                            	  5628:     ; Decrement animation counter; and when it reaches 0:
                            	  5629:     ; 1. arm it again for 2 frames
                            	  5630:     ; 2. advance the minor state within a cycle of 8
                            	  5631:     ; 3. see if it's time to play the sound effect, if the boomerang belongs to Link
                            	  5632:     ;
02:00048D06 41EC03D0        	  5633:     lea     ($03D0,A4),A0
